| description = The Sarnaks, a race which was created by the meddling of the Iksar Necromancers are in an ongoing state of war with the [[Legion of Cabilis]] (the Trooper Guards).

They have a fortress at the Lake of Ill Omen, as well as their ancestral home - the city of Chardok - which is within the burning woods. Another closely related faction is the [[Brood of Di`Zok]].

Sarnaks are highly intelligent, and have a strong presence of magic users within their ranks.  

Their warrior classes also tend to have a high magical resistance rate.

Before the Chardok 2.0 patch there was no way to raise this faction.

